Snapdragon X support for meviusisback/omarchy-hw-monitor, on top of upstream 1.7.0 (6571bdd):
CPU model and temperature from the tsens zones, Adreno GPU (load from book4-gpu-busy,
clock from devfreq, temperature from gpuss), and Commons.Color qualified names.
Applied by install/arch/gpu-busy.sh. Rebased 19 November 2026 from 1.1.1.

